      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "There is no hard FPS limit.\nFPS is limited either to:\n- 90 FPS on desktop\n- VR Headset max refresh rate, when using VR\nYou can also set the FPS limit by using the \"--fps=N\" launch argument, if you like.",
