  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-08-27T18:57:32.305Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "i seen a lot of forums from other websites and seen people only saying that 90fps is to help from tearing so that players won't get motion sickness, i disagree with that because the headset is 90hz even if the fps goes up higher than 90fps you won't see higher than 90 fps. SO what i actually want this game is to increase the fps limit to probably 300fps/infinite(if possible) to make sure not to have massive sudden fps drops, which makes vr user motion sickness even worst right now as the limit is set to 90fps. For future new vr headset as well for the fps limit like probably 120hz headset in the future can help the game run better too, so don't have to waste so much time on it.",
